          "id": "commentary_3_1-guidance-4",
          "type": "commentary_guidance",
          "text": "When considering detail from the \u2018Risk Assessment\u2019 part of the indicative content, at Level 3, please note we are looking for an understanding of the risk, as well as giving a specific measure to control the risk. For Level 3 we need to see both a black bullet point (bp) and a related white bp for the risk assessment, whereas at Level 2 a black bp alone is sufficient. Note that a white bp alone (control measure) is not creditworthy at any level. ",
